{
  "sn16.5:0.1": "Linked Discourses 16.5 ",
  "sn16.5:0.2": "1. Kassapa ",
  "sn16.5:0.3": "Old Age ",
  "sn16.5:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "sn16.5:1.2": "Near Rājagaha, in the Bamboo Grove. ",
  "sn16.5:1.3": "Then Venerable Mahākassapa went up to the Buddha, bowed, and sat down to one side. The Buddha said to him: ",
  "sn16.5:1.4": "“You’re old now, Kassapa. Those worn-out hempen rag robes must be a burden for you. ",
  "sn16.5:1.5": "So Kassapa, you should wear clothes given by householders, accept invitations for the meal, and stay in my presence.” ",
  "sn16.5:2.1": "“For a long time, sir, I’ve lived in the wilderness, eaten only almsfood, worn rag robes, and owned just three robes; and I’ve praised these things. I’ve been one of few wishes, content, secluded, aloof, and energetic; and I’ve praised these things.” ",
  "sn16.5:3.1": "“But seeing what benefit, Kassapa, have you long practiced these things?” ",
  "sn16.5:3.2": "",
  "sn16.5:3.3": "",
  "sn16.5:3.4": "",
  "sn16.5:3.5": "",
  "sn16.5:3.6": "",
  "sn16.5:3.7": "",
  "sn16.5:3.8": "",
  "sn16.5:4.1": "“Sir, seeing two benefits I have long practiced these things. ",
  "sn16.5:4.2": "",
  "sn16.5:4.3": "",
  "sn16.5:4.4": "",
  "sn16.5:4.5": "",
  "sn16.5:4.6": "",
  "sn16.5:4.7": "",
  "sn16.5:4.8": "",
  "sn16.5:5.1": "I see happiness for myself in this life. And I have sympathy for future generations, thinking: ",
  "sn16.5:5.2": "‘Hopefully those who come after might follow my example.’ ",
  "sn16.5:5.3": "For